k"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しい感想聞いてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に貴重な体験をさせていただきましたし沢山の刺激を受けました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだけ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多かった質問へのお返事"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/26/8569431/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑkndly ＝kndlilyはどういう意味なのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗親切に, 優しくしてくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という意味です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑオススメのタピオカってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗パールレディ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/26/8569431/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、本当に美味しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑タピオカタピオカうるさいって？(笑)もう、将来なりたいものはタピオカにしようかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑブラウニーって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラウニーというのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていえばいいのかな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガートーショコラに近いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをもっとしっとりギュッとした凄く凄く美味しい物です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/26/8569431/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑雜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑコメント毎回していい？何回もしていい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然お願いします・゜・(つД｀)・゜・むしろ しておくんなまし（つд；*)←謎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p